# This repository is public, and this folder is where a Save a copy, or a file
# dragged in while trying something out, naturally lands. On 21 September one of
# Kat's lecture decks and a PDF saved from it ended up here and went into a
# commit with a `git add -A`; a push would have published both.
#
# So nothing here is committed unless it is named below. Adding a sample means
# adding its name here as well, which is the point -- it cannot happen by
# accident, only on purpose.
*
!.gitignore
!expected-native.json
!expected-phonemes.json
!expected-reading.json
!sample.pdf
!test-paper.pdf
!test-document.docx
!test-document.epub
!test-document.fb2
!test-document.html
!test-document.md
!test-document.odt
!test-document.rtf
!test-slides.odp
!test-slides.pptx
